Peter Moore, owner of Wisła Kraków and former CEO of Liverpool FC, on the lifetime value (LTV) of a fan, the one asset a club never loses

"Players come and go, managers come and go, owners come and go, but the fan remains. They will give you 10, 20, 50 years of their life, and building that relationship is the real asset."

